			<div class="content" id="post-content-2100332">
									

<p>This is such a very long article, for so very little payoff. It essentially amounts to &quot;Spooky time people kill you if you watch them for too long.&quot;</p>
<p>It started off promisingly, but I started saying to myself &quot;Okay, I get it&quot; over and over, as the wide range of confusing logs and notes were either redundant or conflicting, to the point in which I lost most of my interest. By the time that I got to the end, there was nothing there to keep interest. The ending consists of two pictures that simply validates something that you already said earlier.</p>
<p>I was expecting the article to go out with a bang, but this one just kind of fizzled out.</p>

